WEBVTT

00:00:01.680 --> 00:00:05.770
The time: the Warring States Era.

00:00:05.770 --> 00:00:10.940
The brave men aiming to unify the land heralded in the age with the entire country on the line.

00:00:10.940 --> 00:00:15.180
The one closest to unifying the land was the Devil King of the Sixth Heaven, Oda Nobunaga.

00:00:15.990 --> 00:00:20.790
Nobunaga ruthlessly shot down all those who dared stand in his way.

00:00:20.790 --> 00:00:27.630
His biological sister, Oichi, and her husband, Azai Nagamasa were no exception.

00:00:30.170 --> 00:00:35.090
As the Oda army dyed the land of the rising sun in blood and fear,

00:00:35.090 --> 00:00:37.390
the One-eyed Dragon of Oshu, Date Masamune,

00:00:38.070 --> 00:00:40.910
and the young warrior of the Kai Takeda, Sanada Yukimura,

00:00:41.890 --> 00:00:47.530
aim for Nobunaga’s stronghold in Azuchi together despite formally being enemies themselves.

00:00:49.480 --> 00:00:51.840
We’ll turn Azuchi Castle into the Devil King’s grave!

00:00:51.840 --> 00:00:55.020
We absolutely cannot give our future over to a compassionless general!

00:00:55.020 --> 00:00:57.070
All we shall offer the Devil King are prayers for the dead!

00:00:59.830 --> 00:01:05.520
Thus, their rear guard, comprised of warriors from all over the land, amass at Azuchi.

00:01:06.170 --> 00:01:11.210
From Oshu: Masamune’s long-time confidant and loyal retainer, Katakura Kojuro.

00:01:13.490 --> 00:01:20.870
From Kai: the Tiger of Kai, Takeda Shingen;
and Shingen and Yukimura’s dependable ninja, Sarutobi Sasuke.

00:01:22.310 --> 00:01:28.290
From Eichigo: the general, Uesugi Kenshin and his adoring ninja, Kasuga.

00:01:29.340 --> 00:01:33.320
Further, thanks to the appeals of the Vagabond of the Maeda clan, Maeda Keiji,

00:01:33.410 --> 00:01:41.310
Chosokabe Motochika from Saigoku and Mori Motonari both heeded the call and the siege of the Oda clan was complete.

00:01:44.440 --> 00:01:45.330
You finish this.

00:01:45.330 --> 00:01:47.480
I shall, though it may cost me my life.

00:01:49.070 --> 00:01:54.860
With the hearts and minds of the states behind them, Masamune and Yukimura defeated Nobunaga.

00:02:06.730 --> 00:02:14.190
With Nobunaga’s death and the wealth and might of the country behind him, the Despot King, Toyotomi Hideyoshi,

00:02:14.190 --> 00:02:19.280
along with his strategist, Takenaka Hanbei, sought world domination and once again the land was plunged into turmoil.

00:02:27.310 --> 00:02:34.960
With Masmune, set on making a comeback having been once defeated by the surprising power of the Toyotomi, heading for Osaka,

00:02:34.960 --> 00:02:40.820
and Yukimura, setting out on an expedition to Saigoku on Shingen’s orders, having caught wind of the Toyotomi plot,

00:02:42.270 --> 00:02:45.950
they were both moving to defeat the Toyotomi, though their paths may have differed.

00:02:45.950 --> 00:02:50.760
They both walked the paths they believe in, overcoming trial after trial.

00:02:51.720 --> 00:02:57.390
And then, just as the Toyotomi army headed complete its dominion of the land,

00:02:57.390 --> 00:03:01.400
Mori Motonari, who had formed an alliance with the Toyotomi, rose in rebellion.

00:03:01.770 --> 00:03:08.410
And Yukimura, who had allied with the Satsuma Army amidst the chaos, took him down.

00:03:09.410 --> 00:03:16.480
Meanwhile, in Odawara, Masamune’s brings his fight to the death with Hideyoshi to a close, managing a narrow victory.

00:03:23.310 --> 00:03:28.230
And with that, it seemed like these turbulent times were coming to an end,

00:03:28.230 --> 00:03:31.940
but the destruction of the Toyotomi heralded in a third wave of turmoil.

00:03:33.240 --> 00:03:36.020
Two of Hideyoshi’s subordinates:

00:03:36.020 --> 00:03:40.820
Tokugawa Ieyasu, aiming to unify the nation with heartfelt bonds,

00:03:40.820 --> 00:03:45.750
and Ishida Mitsunari, hunting down Masamune to avenge Hideyoshi.

00:03:47.360 --> 00:03:53.820
Thus, with the entangled feelings of Masamune, Yukimura and the other generals,

00:03:53.820 --> 00:03:58.960
the greatest battle of the Warring States Era was about to explode.

00:05:13.530 --> 00:05:18.350
With the defeat of the Oda and the end of the Toyotomi Era,

00:05:18.350 --> 00:05:24.300
countless wars brought forth untold sorrow and regret.

00:05:29.220 --> 00:05:34.940
And that, at times, transforms the souls of those left behind into a hell fire of carnage.

00:05:35.840 --> 00:05:41.060
Their fates which ought to have been meager, warp, seized with uncertainty.

00:05:43.520 --> 00:05:46.060
Here is one such soul.

00:05:52.050 --> 00:05:53.950
Lord Hideyoshi...

00:05:54.600 --> 00:05:57.350
Lord...Hideyoshi!

00:05:57.350 --> 00:06:01.460
LORD...HIDEYOSHI!

00:06:09.980 --> 00:06:11.600
The Lamenting.

00:06:11.600 --> 00:06:14.810
His name: Ishida Mitsunari.

00:06:18.900 --> 00:06:24.450
Let the game begin! Amidst the profusion of florid colors

00:06:24.450 --> 00:06:29.070
Wills to fight intertwine

00:06:29.980 --> 00:06:35.040
How numerously those bonds gush fourth from their Flags

00:06:35.040 --> 00:06:49.650
Those that carve up the brilliance shall herald in a new age

00:06:54.570 --> 00:07:00.120
Their lust, like a Crazy Storm, compels them to paint

00:07:00.120 --> 00:07:05.560
A rainbow that sparkles only at night, they are drawn to it even though it makes their hearts pound

00:07:05.880 --> 00:07:11.060
They hold their breath in anticipation, at the mercy of each other’s eyes

00:07:11.390 --> 00:07:16.690
They don’t budge, not even one step, as the brilliance draws near

00:07:16.690 --> 00:07:21.560
They aimed for the heavens!

00:07:22.070 --> 00:07:27.600
Gather! At the banquet of flowers hastening to bloom at the summit

00:07:27.600 --> 00:07:32.340
A storm crashes through tomorrow

00:07:33.000 --> 00:07:38.150
How wonderously those souls spring forth from their Flags

00:07:38.150 --> 00:07:52.750
If they don’t sprint through the moment, their lives will never be set ablaze

00:07:57.310 --> 00:08:02.510
You, who will carve up the brilliance!

00:08:02.510 --> 00:08:12.820
Create a new age!

00:08:26.670 --> 00:08:28.520
I shall not allow you to beg for your life.

00:08:41.460 --> 00:08:43.540
L-Lord Mogami!

00:08:44.780 --> 00:08:46.750
The enemy is not a great army!

00:08:46.750 --> 00:08:50.210
Hm? What ever do you mean?

00:08:51.900 --> 00:08:53.090
I-It’s a single man!

00:08:54.980 --> 00:08:58.720
Hmph. Just when I thought it was a whole army, it’s just a skinny little boy.

00:08:59.200 --> 00:09:02.890
That’s much more convenient.

00:09:05.310 --> 00:09:06.710
A gentleman...!

00:09:06.940 --> 00:09:09.400
...is never violent!

00:09:10.670 --> 00:09:13.860
I know <i>all</i> about you, my boy.

00:09:13.860 --> 00:09:16.660
Now then, come here Ando, or whatever!

00:09:18.030 --> 00:09:21.540
I don’t know who you are, but let’s be friends!

00:09:22.240 --> 00:09:26.600
As a token of our friendship, have a Getting-to-know-you-Genmaicha!

00:09:26.600 --> 00:09:30.040
And look, the tea leaves are aligned auspiciously!

00:09:30.040 --> 00:09:35.590
Certainly, you wouldn’t do anything reckless when you’re at such an overwhelming disadvantage, would you, my boy?

00:09:42.350 --> 00:09:43.690
Begone.

00:09:43.690 --> 00:09:45.920
Refusal is not an option.

00:09:45.920 --> 00:09:49.190
Those that hinder me are just as guilty as <i>he</i> is.

00:09:49.190 --> 00:09:51.630
W-Who’s ‘he’?

00:09:51.630 --> 00:09:59.890
You wouldn’t happen to have come here to kill the splendid, sly fox of Ushu, Mogami Yoshiaki, would you, my boy?

00:09:59.890 --> 00:10:02.180
Save your shenanigans for your mustache.

00:10:02.180 --> 00:10:05.190
W-wait!

00:10:08.090 --> 00:10:10.340
The one I am after...!

00:10:10.340 --> 00:10:12.340
...Is <i>me</i>, brah.

00:10:18.600 --> 00:10:20.290
GOOD SPIRIT!

00:10:20.290 --> 00:10:24.700
Pretty ballsy of you to try and get REVENGE on your own, Toyotomi leftovers.

00:10:25.300 --> 00:10:27.480
I came here to say ‘sup.

00:10:31.710 --> 00:10:33.900
T-T-T-There you are!

00:10:33.900 --> 00:10:36.470
I was waiting for you!

00:10:36.470 --> 00:10:37.990
How do you like that, Yamada or whatever!

00:10:37.990 --> 00:10:41.290
He’s my bosom buddy, the One Eyed Dragon of Oshu-

00:10:41.290 --> 00:10:45.000
HA! Yeah right, old fart.

00:10:45.000 --> 00:10:48.500
You’re more BFFs with tea cups than a dragon!

00:10:49.160 --> 00:10:50.800
It’s <i>you</i>!

00:10:51.320 --> 00:10:55.750
Do whatever you want to that GENTLEMAN, I’ll wait.

00:10:55.750 --> 00:10:58.390
V-V-Violence is bad!

00:11:03.520 --> 00:11:05.680
Lord Hideyoshi...

00:11:05.680 --> 00:11:12.800
...give me permission to decapitate this man in vengeance!

00:11:16.820 --> 00:11:18.960
Who the hell are you?

00:11:18.960 --> 00:11:21.360
I have no name for the likes of you...!

00:11:27.090 --> 00:11:28.600
MARVELOUS!

00:11:29.610 --> 00:11:30.790
This is not a game!

00:11:36.130 --> 00:11:37.900
Unforgivable...!

00:11:37.900 --> 00:11:40.090
I shall never forgive you!

00:11:51.570 --> 00:11:53.290
Not bad, but...

00:11:56.230 --> 00:11:58.980
I’m Date Masamune, Head of the Oshu Gang!

00:11:59.480 --> 00:12:03.110
And, sorry brah, but there’s only one dude in these Warring States

00:12:03.170 --> 00:12:06.410
who can, unironically, HEAT this dragon UP!

00:12:25.100 --> 00:12:26.510
COOL OFF!

00:12:26.510 --> 00:12:29.160
You can’t beat me with resentment alone.

00:12:29.160 --> 00:12:31.710
Fly your own flag, dude.

00:12:31.710 --> 00:12:33.270
Then we can talk.

00:12:33.270 --> 00:12:35.910
Let’s go at it, with the land as the prize.

00:12:35.910 --> 00:12:36.770
YOU SEE?

00:12:36.770 --> 00:12:38.950
As if I care about the likes of the land!

00:12:38.950 --> 00:12:42.950
I desire nothing more than to end your sorry life!

00:12:52.080 --> 00:12:56.310
If you wanna mourn General Monkey that badly, why don’t you go cry at his grave?

00:12:56.310 --> 00:13:02.010
You... How dare a criminal insult my Lord Hideyoshi with such a churlish nickname!

00:13:03.630 --> 00:13:04.760
KEEP IT UP!

00:13:04.760 --> 00:13:05.550
HA!

00:13:08.140 --> 00:13:09.720
You bastard!

00:13:09.720 --> 00:13:11.930
Let me execute you!

00:13:12.730 --> 00:13:14.140
Unforgivable!

00:13:14.140 --> 00:13:17.980
I shall never forgive you for your crimes!

00:13:17.980 --> 00:13:22.850
Date Masamuneeeeee!

00:13:35.210 --> 00:13:38.630
I should not expect anything less from my eternal rival.

00:13:38.630 --> 00:13:42.600
It was a complete defeat, Tiger of Kai.

00:13:42.600 --> 00:13:46.840
Thanks to you, I have spent half my life full of vigor.

00:13:46.840 --> 00:13:50.100
You have my heartfelt thanks, Kenshin.

00:13:53.540 --> 00:13:57.600
I leave the future of Echigo, to the Tiger of Kai.

00:13:58.760 --> 00:14:03.300
Trust this man and devote your energies to him.

00:14:03.300 --> 00:14:04.590
Understand?

00:14:14.570 --> 00:14:15.700
Milord...!

00:14:16.550 --> 00:14:19.220
Yukimura, observe well.

00:14:19.220 --> 00:14:22.290
Some day, this time shall come for you.

00:14:23.970 --> 00:14:24.930
Yessir!

00:14:30.040 --> 00:14:34.990
We must part, my beautiful blade...

00:14:37.790 --> 00:14:40.100
Farewell, Kenshin...!

00:14:45.570 --> 00:14:47.740
Lord Shingen!

00:15:00.540 --> 00:15:01.300
That’s-!

00:15:01.530 --> 00:15:04.460
Sir Tokugawa... Ieyasu!?

00:15:04.790 --> 00:15:06.210
You mustn’t sever your bonds!

00:15:06.300 --> 00:15:07.580
Lord Shingen!

00:15:13.030 --> 00:15:14.260
The Light of the East...

00:15:15.980 --> 00:15:17.030
It’s you, Takechiyo.

00:15:18.120 --> 00:15:20.020
It has been too long.

00:15:20.030 --> 00:15:22.470
You’ve certainly grown.

00:15:24.240 --> 00:15:29.030
I guess I have, but you are still bigger.

00:15:29.640 --> 00:15:32.460
I am glad to see you are as healthy as ever.

00:15:33.490 --> 00:15:36.110
You seem well too, Sanada Yukimura.

00:15:36.740 --> 00:15:39.320
It has been ages since last we met, Sir Ieyasu.

00:15:42.530 --> 00:15:44.790
I came here today with a singular purpose:

00:15:44.790 --> 00:15:48.690
to convey my determination to Lord Shingen and to Lord Kenshin as well.

00:15:51.870 --> 00:15:59.850
I, Tokugawa Ieyasu, have firmly resolved to unify the Land of the Rising Sun with the power of bonds.

00:16:04.120 --> 00:16:05.790
“This is the last time.”

00:16:05.790 --> 00:16:08.900
So everyone says and so everyone believes,

00:16:08.900 --> 00:16:11.780
but thus far we have been repeating the same actions over and over.

00:16:12.860 --> 00:16:16.530
However, each time someone tries to seize the land,

00:16:16.530 --> 00:16:20.580
yet another appears and the world descends into the chaos of war.

00:16:22.260 --> 00:16:28.590
This time, I want to bring an end to this world in which those who believe in tomorrow cannot live to see it.

00:16:29.100 --> 00:16:34.030
Thus, you have preemptively removed your helmet and cast away your spear?

00:16:34.030 --> 00:16:34.980
Indeed I have.

00:16:34.980 --> 00:16:41.510
In sum, you can wait no longer for the time to be ripe.

00:16:41.510 --> 00:16:43.640
That is correct, Lord Shingen.

00:16:43.900 --> 00:16:48.550
To wait any longer would be tantamount to wishing for the ruin of our country.

00:16:48.550 --> 00:16:53.360
“Waiting for the time to be ripe” would mean “missing an opportunity."

00:16:54.300 --> 00:17:00.260
I cannot think of anything more heartening than the two of you, the Tiger of Kai and the War God of Echigo,

00:17:00.260 --> 00:17:03.300
bound by such deep bonds, lending me your strength hand-in-hand.

00:17:07.350 --> 00:17:09.560
Ieyasu,

00:17:09.560 --> 00:17:14.640
I understand your thoughts but, no one will lend you their ears.

00:17:17.750 --> 00:17:21.020
Certainly, if obtaining universal approval were a simple task,

00:17:21.020 --> 00:17:23.440
no one would go to war in the first place.

00:17:24.160 --> 00:17:27.430
Only two were willing to listen, having paid me a visit in response to rumors:

00:17:27.430 --> 00:17:32.610
the Vagabond of the Maeda and the Demon of the West Sea.

00:17:33.660 --> 00:17:36.450
But even so, I–

00:17:49.390 --> 00:17:50.360
Milord...!

00:17:54.750 --> 00:17:57.940
Then, try to achieve it.

00:18:01.460 --> 00:18:05.200
Thank you, Lord Shingen, Lord Kenshin.

00:18:06.060 --> 00:18:08.060
We will meet again, Sanada.

00:18:33.150 --> 00:18:35.550
MILORDDD!

00:18:36.170 --> 00:18:37.710
What is so urgent?

00:18:37.710 --> 00:18:42.180
I am most busy with the expansion of the Takeda territory.

00:18:42.180 --> 00:18:46.490
There is a matter I wish to report to you, Milord!

00:18:46.490 --> 00:18:47.920
Speak.

00:18:47.920 --> 00:18:48.870
Yessir!

00:18:48.870 --> 00:18:51.990
There has been something smoldering in this chest of mine

00:18:51.990 --> 00:18:58.000
since after returning from my previous trip to Satsuma and doing battle with the Mori.

00:18:58.790 --> 00:19:06.210
It was but a vague feeling and, try as I might, I could not give it to words.

00:19:06.210 --> 00:19:10.890
But, Lord Ieyasu has shown me what it was through his example.

00:19:14.710 --> 00:19:17.330
You’re too naive, Yukimura.

00:19:17.330 --> 00:19:20.090
A thousand pardons, however...

00:19:20.090 --> 00:19:23.860
Lord Ieyasu’s unparalleled determination to achieve, with a single fist, what all others have long given up on,

00:19:23.860 --> 00:19:36.400
nay, what none have even attempted in this war-torn age has set my heart hopelessly ablaze!

00:19:43.780 --> 00:19:49.770
You are telling me that, for the sake of tomorrow, you are prepared to abandon those spears of yours henceforth?

00:19:49.770 --> 00:19:52.630
Those spears you thoroughly tempered and continued to refine?

00:19:52.630 --> 00:19:53.630
Yessir!

00:19:57.340 --> 00:19:58.440
Yukimura!

00:19:58.440 --> 00:19:58.970
Yessir!

00:19:59.630 --> 00:20:00.830
That’s...

00:20:00.830 --> 00:20:01.930
good!

00:20:01.930 --> 00:20:03.000
Yessir!

00:20:03.990 --> 00:20:05.930
That’s... GOOD!

00:20:05.930 --> 00:20:08.140
YUUUKIMURAAAAA!

00:20:08.140 --> 00:20:09.780
WHAA-?

00:20:15.320 --> 00:20:17.320
Milord?!

00:20:17.320 --> 00:20:18.980
Now that’s a true warrior!

00:20:19.760 --> 00:20:23.430
This is not a decision born out of youthful impetuosity!

00:20:23.430 --> 00:20:27.070
Nay, it is what all men should aspire to!

00:20:27.070 --> 00:20:32.130
Now, in my stead, blaze a trail to tomorrow!

00:20:33.250 --> 00:20:34.670
Milord...!

00:20:35.030 --> 00:20:40.170
Now is the time, more than ever, as you have fallen into the abyss of agony and devoted yourself to your studies,

00:20:40.170 --> 00:20:45.840
and now as you have acquired the spirit, skills and also strength of the martial arts!

00:20:45.840 --> 00:20:50.960
Know this! You and Ieyasu can achieve it!

00:20:59.380 --> 00:21:01.400
Understoooood!

00:21:01.400 --> 00:21:03.520
Miiiiiiloooord!

00:21:03.520 --> 00:21:05.720
Yuuukimuraaaa!

00:21:08.670 --> 00:21:10.250
Miiiiiiloooord!

00:21:11.530 --> 00:21:13.230
Yuuukimuraaaa!

00:21:13.620 --> 00:21:15.710
Miiiiiiloooord!

00:21:16.380 --> 00:21:19.130
Yuuukimuraaaa!

00:21:20.170 --> 00:21:22.510
Miiiiiiiiiiloooooooooooooooooord!

00:21:22.510 --> 00:21:24.470
Yuuuuukimuraaaaaaaaaaaaaaa!

00:21:35.730 --> 00:21:37.750
Wait a sec, this is getting serious!

00:21:43.680 --> 00:21:46.290
Mi...lorb...

00:21:46.290 --> 00:21:48.830
Yuki...bura...

00:22:16.660 --> 00:22:17.720
Milord!

00:22:18.740 --> 00:22:20.230
Milord!

00:22:23.990 --> 00:22:26.240
Yukimura...

00:22:26.240 --> 00:22:34.300
I, Takeda Shingen, have taught you all that I know.

00:22:34.300 --> 00:22:39.110
You’ve adjudged the God of War and have surpassed me.

00:22:39.880 --> 00:22:44.830
I entrust the spirit of the Tiger to you.

00:22:44.830 --> 00:22:47.110
Yuki...mura...!

00:22:49.400 --> 00:22:50.690
Milord!

00:22:50.690 --> 00:22:52.290
Milord!?

00:22:52.290 --> 00:22:55.630
Miiiiiiilooooord!

00:22:55.630 --> 00:22:58.980
He could’ve just retired like a normal person.

00:22:58.980 --> 00:23:00.450
Sasuke!

00:23:00.450 --> 00:23:02.230
There have been signs of unrest in various places.

00:23:02.230 --> 00:23:05.660
I’m assuming I should report to you now, General.

00:23:12.490 --> 00:23:13.420
Boss!

00:23:14.020 --> 00:23:15.540
Lord Masamune!

00:23:16.200 --> 00:23:20.100
Where did you go off to without mobilizing the troops?

00:23:20.100 --> 00:23:26.060
We should have intercepted the unidentified intruder who trespassed upon Oshu before leaving Mogami’s territory––

00:23:26.060 --> 00:23:28.880
There was only one opponent, Kojuro.

00:23:29.540 --> 00:23:30.350
What?!

00:23:30.350 --> 00:23:31.470
Just one person?

00:23:31.470 --> 00:23:33.370
No big deal, dude.

00:23:33.370 --> 00:23:42.970
I just had to roll out the welcome wagon for that desperate, REVENGE-crazed Toyotomi survivor––

00:23:53.030 --> 00:23:54.350
Lord Masamune?!

00:24:08.400 --> 00:24:10.870
B-Boss?

00:24:10.870 --> 00:24:12.110
Boss?!

00:24:14.500 --> 00:24:17.970
Booooooooss!!

00:24:44.550 --> 00:24:47.960
Have you tired of strolling about, Mitsunari?

00:24:57.870 --> 00:24:59.490
Date Masamune,

00:24:59.490 --> 00:25:02.700
I care not if you abase me,

00:25:02.700 --> 00:25:09.410
but there is no meaning in making mincemeat out of you if you continue to scorn my Lord Hideyoshi.

00:25:12.280 --> 00:25:17.550
That knave used my own self to further blaspheme my Lord Hideyoshi!

00:25:17.550 --> 00:25:21.490
I must make him repent before granting him the death penalty!

00:25:21.490 --> 00:25:27.770
Hee hee, there are few that take others’ words as seriously as you do, Sire.

00:25:28.430 --> 00:25:32.300
Speak your mind clearly and concisely, Magistrate.

00:25:32.300 --> 00:25:37.720
I know not what manner of cowardly tactics the One Eyed Dragon used to entomb the regent,

00:25:38.380 --> 00:25:45.790
but, his refusal fight one who does not command an army? It is, perhaps, just a makeshift excuse.

00:25:45.790 --> 00:25:50.890
You may have failed to kill him, but surely you made him run away with his tail between his legs.

00:25:50.890 --> 00:25:53.080
Do you not believe that, Sire?
You may have failed to kill him, but surely you made him run away with his tail between his legs.

00:25:53.080 --> 00:25:53.860
Do you not believe that, Sire?

00:25:53.860 --> 00:25:56.780
If it is as you say...

00:25:56.780 --> 00:25:59.020
It is all the more unforgivable!

00:25:59.030 --> 00:26:04.090
For such a weakling to have felled Lord Hideyoshi!

00:26:04.950 --> 00:26:10.320
There is no need to raise an army against such a weak foe.

00:26:10.320 --> 00:26:14.490
It would be prudent tempt him into action and lie in wait.

00:26:14.490 --> 00:26:16.270
I shall make arrangements.

00:26:17.670 --> 00:26:18.980
I leave it all to you.

00:26:19.470 --> 00:26:22.030
Are you not curious about my choice of tactic?

00:26:22.030 --> 00:26:24.940
I have no time to doubt you.

00:26:24.940 --> 00:26:26.430
I see.

00:26:27.590 --> 00:26:30.750
All for honor, all for you, Sire.

00:27:07.170 --> 00:27:10.220
Lord Masamune! You still mustn’t move around too––

00:27:10.220 --> 00:27:12.430
Found out who that dude was?

00:27:12.920 --> 00:27:15.970
Yessir, Ishida Mitsunari.

00:27:15.970 --> 00:27:21.910
After invading Oshu alone, it appears that he led an army and attacked a variety of places.

00:27:22.690 --> 00:27:28.070
And after mercilessly visiting violence upon not only soldiers, but unarmed civilians as well,

00:27:28.070 --> 00:27:31.090
he makes a show of raising his own flag and leaves.

00:27:31.930 --> 00:27:33.250
Wholesale slaughter?

00:27:33.850 --> 00:27:37.420
The generals of the other states are now filled with trepidation.

00:27:37.420 --> 00:27:42.530
They call Ishida Mitsunari, “The Minister of Misfortune,” for they fear and detest him.

00:27:44.030 --> 00:27:44.900
Kojuro...

00:27:44.900 --> 00:27:45.430
Yes?

00:27:46.460 --> 00:27:48.140
I’m gonna go beat up Ishida.

00:27:51.050 --> 00:27:55.990
Back there, I, the One Eyed Dragon, used mere words to distract him

00:27:55.990 --> 00:28:00.900
and turned my tail and ran from an enemy!

00:28:05.550 --> 00:28:07.960
This world is vast.

00:28:08.440 --> 00:28:09.340
Huh?

00:28:09.340 --> 00:28:14.910
Your decision to refrain from needlessly crossing swords with a revenge-crazed assassin

00:28:15.430 --> 00:28:20.230
is most befitting of one who’s duty is to care for and protect Oshu.

00:28:21.830 --> 00:28:24.930
I have rebuked you for recklessly going out alone,

00:28:25.310 --> 00:28:28.600
but thanks to you, this land avoided violation

00:28:28.600 --> 00:28:31.950
and the soldiers and civilians carry on their normal, daily lives.

00:28:33.600 --> 00:28:40.120
Do not believe for a moment that only those who go to extremes for military valor are worthy of becoming Conqueror of the Land.

00:28:40.120 --> 00:28:46.540
I haven’t the faintest idea as to why you feel responsible for Ishida’s subsequent deeds.

00:28:46.540 --> 00:28:49.560
I’m the one who pissed that dude off.

00:28:49.560 --> 00:28:52.750
I told him to come back again after he flew his own flag.

00:28:53.070 --> 00:28:55.380
Gotta settle things with him.

00:28:56.090 --> 00:28:58.250
In that case, there is one thing I must say.

00:29:00.120 --> 00:29:03.280
Next time, I shall not let you go alone.

00:29:13.130 --> 00:29:15.650
The King of Misfortune, huh?

00:29:16.940 --> 00:29:19.320
Yeah, that dude was CRAZY.

00:29:20.110 --> 00:29:21.040
But...

00:29:25.600 --> 00:29:28.320
Why did he have such clear eyes?

00:29:34.220 --> 00:29:43.630
As forces began to make secret maneuvers in response to the Ishida army,

00:29:43.630 --> 00:29:49.450
Tokugawa Ieyasu, Maeda Keiji, and Chosokabe Motochika, tried launching a full-blown walking tour about the country

00:29:49.450 --> 00:29:53.190
in order to convince the lords of the states that it was not a day too soon to end the war-torn age.

00:30:02.450 --> 00:30:03.510
Ieyasu...

00:30:04.480 --> 00:30:08.990
You scoundrel, why do you refuse to avenge Lord Hideyoshi with me?

00:30:09.510 --> 00:30:13.750
How can you forget Lord Hideyoshi’s kindness and abandon the Toyotomi?

00:30:14.230 --> 00:30:17.400
Sir Hideyoshi was too concerned with power.

00:30:18.660 --> 00:30:22.420
If left unchecked, the Toyotomi would have spread the fires of war to the whole world,

00:30:22.420 --> 00:30:27.280
and even more people would die and fall into despair.

00:30:27.280 --> 00:30:30.760
You... Just what did you see when you were with them?

00:30:30.760 --> 00:30:37.390
Lord Hideyoshi sought power with that indefatigable heart of his and fought to protect the pride of this country,

00:30:37.390 --> 00:30:41.760
so that the Land of the Rising Sun would not fall to ruin!

00:30:41.760 --> 00:30:43.610
Listen to me, Mitsunari.

00:30:43.610 --> 00:30:49.250
I am as guilty as anyone of admiring heroes from a far.

00:30:50.150 --> 00:30:51.640
But, I have learned something in doing so.

00:30:51.640 --> 00:30:53.530
Ironically, their actions were not so heroic.

00:30:56.750 --> 00:30:59.300
Power exists not to be used.

00:30:59.300 --> 00:31:05.210
One must have the strength of both body and heart never to brandish it in order to protect our bonds.

00:31:05.700 --> 00:31:07.970
That is what true heroism is.

00:31:08.610 --> 00:31:12.980
That is what I should have told Sir Hideyoshi...

00:31:13.320 --> 00:31:16.310
My crime was my failure to do so.

00:31:16.310 --> 00:31:18.970
Had I, perhaps Sir Hideyoshi would still be alive.

00:31:19.680 --> 00:31:21.960
Know your place, Ieyasu!

00:31:23.240 --> 00:31:25.940
You disgust me with your impertinent talk!

00:31:25.940 --> 00:31:30.360
What can any man other than Lord Hideyoshi accomplish with a naked fist alone?

00:31:31.010 --> 00:31:36.080
Prove it to me before this blade, wet with my bitter tears of blood!

00:31:37.630 --> 00:31:40.440
Mitsunari, I came here to talk to you!

00:31:41.150 --> 00:31:44.420
As a friend, I wanted to make sure you understood first.

00:31:45.030 --> 00:31:48.020
There is nothing I need to hear from the likes of you.

00:31:48.020 --> 00:31:49.670
I have no need for friendship!

00:31:50.170 --> 00:31:51.740
Why do you think that?

00:31:51.740 --> 00:31:55.360
You, just as Sir Hanbei was to Sir Hideyoshi–

00:31:55.360 --> 00:31:57.850
How dare you frivolously speak their names!

00:31:57.850 --> 00:32:03.280
Lord Hideyoshi and Lord Hanbei shared a bond deeper than a mere mortal could understand!

00:32:03.800 --> 00:32:05.280
Yes, a bond!

00:32:06.780 --> 00:32:09.440
Those two shared a deep bond!

00:32:09.440 --> 00:32:11.730
And so did Sir Hideyoshi and Keiji!

00:32:12.870 --> 00:32:14.250
Maeda Keiji...

00:32:15.220 --> 00:32:19.720
He committed the folly of standing in Lord Hideyoshi’s way as he headed for Odawara.

00:32:19.720 --> 00:32:21.400
He is deserving of certain death!

00:32:21.400 --> 00:32:23.270
He the very picture of self-righteousness!

00:32:23.270 --> 00:32:25.790
I shall indict him after Date Masamune!

00:32:26.150 --> 00:32:28.510
I don’t believe that.

00:32:28.510 --> 00:32:32.020
Keiji believed in his bonds with Sir Hideyoshi,

00:32:32.020 --> 00:32:34.010
and I believe his actions are the very symbol of those who will live from hereon.

00:32:37.850 --> 00:32:40.800
Do not glorify those that defied Lord Hideyoshi!

00:32:40.800 --> 00:32:43.240
Do not talk about Lord Hideyoshi as if he represents bygone days!

00:32:43.240 --> 00:32:49.960
Lord Hideyoshi is the one who should have lived from hereon and blazed a trail to tomorrow with his sword!

00:32:50.350 --> 00:32:54.200
Lord Hideyoshi, was my everything!

00:32:54.200 --> 00:32:55.360
Mitsunari!

00:33:00.590 --> 00:33:03.320
I refuse to indulge you in any further conversation.

00:33:03.320 --> 00:33:08.460
I shall never forgive that man who stole my Lord Hideyoshi away!

00:33:08.460 --> 00:33:13.550
This world that is on the verge of forgetting Lord Hideyoshi, is unforgivable! The lot of it!

00:33:28.800 --> 00:33:30.850
What a pretty flower garden...

00:33:36.220 --> 00:33:41.910
They said something wonderful will happen if I make a lot of flowers bloom...

00:33:43.020 --> 00:33:47.630
So Ichi is going to try very hard to make them bloom.

00:33:48.300 --> 00:33:50.640
My brother is laughing...

00:33:51.080 --> 00:33:52.920
I’m so happy...

00:34:12.080 --> 00:34:13.910
Wonderful!

00:34:13.910 --> 00:34:15.290
Yes!

00:34:15.290 --> 00:34:18.470
More! Accumulate more of them! Lady Oichi!

00:34:18.760 --> 00:34:22.200
I’m scared, Father Tenkai...!

00:34:22.650 --> 00:34:25.630
Legatus, you truly are a timid one.

00:34:25.630 --> 00:34:28.600
It will be fine as long as you offer up a prayer to Buddha.

00:34:28.600 --> 00:34:32.250
No, you offer up a prayer to Buddha! Aren’t you a priest?

00:34:32.250 --> 00:34:36.010
Fret not. I shall hold a memorial service for them en masse.

00:34:36.010 --> 00:34:38.260
Is it going well?

00:34:38.950 --> 00:34:41.050
Don’t surprise me like that, Mr. Otani...

00:34:43.010 --> 00:34:46.320
Before long, everything shall be in order.

00:34:46.320 --> 00:34:48.230
And what of you?

00:34:48.550 --> 00:34:52.070
Mitsunari does not doubt me.

00:34:52.070 --> 00:34:55.690
Magistrate, you seem quite friendly with the King of Misfortune.

00:34:56.820 --> 00:35:00.950
Credence is not something so easily obtained.

00:35:00.950 --> 00:35:05.370
I am not working for his benefit.

00:35:05.370 --> 00:35:09.330
I am merely noting that Mitsunari does not suspect a thing.

00:35:10.100 --> 00:35:15.060
The Devil Queen of the Fifth Heaven... Lady Oichi and the King of Misfortune, Ishida Mitsunari.

00:35:15.850 --> 00:35:24.630
An impeccable medium for channeling the true banquet that I desire and the destruction you wish for.

00:35:24.630 --> 00:35:27.390
...and Legatus shall provide the finishing touches.

00:35:28.490 --> 00:35:31.070
Huh!? Y-yeah.

00:35:36.110 --> 00:35:38.780
Juuuust you waiiiit, Booooosss!

00:35:41.280 --> 00:35:43.530
Boooooossss!

00:35:43.620 --> 00:35:46.200
CHEEECK IT OUUUT, YO!

00:35:50.850 --> 00:35:52.290
Yoshinao!

00:35:58.550 --> 00:36:01.030
Hey, Y-Yoshinao!

00:36:01.030 --> 00:36:02.110
Where were you hit?

00:36:03.220 --> 00:36:05.160
...A crow?

00:36:05.160 --> 00:36:06.010
What!?

00:36:15.050 --> 00:36:17.800
Hey, long time no see.

00:36:17.800 --> 00:36:19.110
Mr. Keiji!

00:36:22.000 --> 00:36:23.480
What’s up?

00:36:23.480 --> 00:36:25.830
Just wanted to see the One Eyed Dragon.

00:36:25.830 --> 00:36:26.740
How’s he been?

00:36:27.120 --> 00:36:30.410
The Boss said he was gonna settle things with Ishida Mitsunari.

00:36:30.410 --> 00:36:33.170
We’re chasing after him right now.

00:36:33.170 --> 00:36:36.570
Gonna go mess up Tokugawa after we beat up Ishida!

00:36:36.800 --> 00:36:37.800
Huh?

00:36:37.800 --> 00:36:41.390
The Boss... feels responsible.

00:36:41.390 --> 00:36:46.640
And now even Tokugawa is taking advantage of the Ishida troops’ random acts of violence...

00:36:46.640 --> 00:36:52.440
I’ve heard the rumors, but Ieyasu wouldn’t do such a thing––

00:36:54.430 --> 00:36:55.010
Hey.

00:36:55.550 --> 00:36:56.860
What’s stuck in your hair?

00:36:57.230 --> 00:36:58.060
Huh?

00:37:00.300 --> 00:37:02.880
Why would that be in...!

00:37:02.880 --> 00:37:04.350
This is...

00:37:04.350 --> 00:37:06.240
...a letter to the Boss.

00:37:07.100 --> 00:37:08.730
From Tokugawa Ieyasu!

00:37:08.730 --> 00:37:09.900
What?!

00:37:11.430 --> 00:37:12.950
Lemme take a look.

00:37:12.950 --> 00:37:14.350
Hey, wait!

00:37:14.350 --> 00:37:16.180
But, uh, that’s...

00:37:16.180 --> 00:37:17.490
...for the Boss.

00:37:17.490 --> 00:37:18.540
You can’t!

00:37:20.070 --> 00:37:21.210
This is...!

00:37:23.110 --> 00:37:26.330
I am Tokugawa Ieyasu.

00:37:26.330 --> 00:37:30.700
One who desires from the bottom of his heart to govern the lands with the power of bonds.

00:37:32.040 --> 00:37:38.070
I have visited every corner of the land and advocated the importance of bonds to everyone.

00:37:38.680 --> 00:37:43.700
However, regrettably, not one person responded to my appeal.

00:37:46.590 --> 00:37:49.320
With each battle, no matter how much we exhaust ourselves

00:37:49.780 --> 00:37:53.280
or how often we experience the grief of losing something irreplaceable

00:37:55.060 --> 00:38:00.450
no one in this Land of the Rising Sun tries to believe in the power of bonds.

00:38:00.450 --> 00:38:03.300
This reality has sunk deep into my mind and I understand now...

00:38:04.080 --> 00:38:09.000
Therefore, shameful as it may be, I have no option but to change my methods.

00:38:09.000 --> 00:38:14.400
It precisely because my will is unyielding that I must resort to force.

00:38:14.400 --> 00:38:19.500
I would like you to understand that, at any time, the Tokugawa could do as Ishida Mitsunari,

00:38:19.500 --> 00:38:22.510
who has been rampaging about as he pleases.

00:38:23.610 --> 00:38:28.200
Now, I have even started to think that this Land of the Rising Sun,

00:38:28.200 --> 00:38:30.370
filled with those poor in spirit who do not try to take each other’s hands,

00:38:30.370 --> 00:38:35.250
might be better off being destroyed along with the villainous Ishida army.

00:38:37.680 --> 00:38:41.040
However, I understand that is nothing more than my own imprudence.

00:38:41.770 --> 00:38:45.610
Therefore, I would like to speak with everyone once more.

00:38:47.790 --> 00:38:54.060
On September 15th, at daybreak, I would like for you to all gather on the grounds of Sekigahara in Mino.

00:38:54.800 --> 00:38:59.620
To all warriors born and raised in the Land of the Rising Sun who grieve for its future.

00:39:01.080 --> 00:39:02.980
––Tokugawa Ieyasu

00:39:05.360 --> 00:39:10.030
Methinks Sir Ieyasu would not do something so craven and backhanded!

00:39:10.280 --> 00:39:15.660
It’s just a rumor that he ended up resorting to force after no one gave him

00:39:15.660 --> 00:39:19.750
the time of day when he visited the states to bring peace to the land.

00:39:19.750 --> 00:39:22.690
Well, you’d normally think it was pretty shady.

00:39:22.690 --> 00:39:25.710
To be talking about “bonds” all of a sudden in this day and age.

00:39:25.710 --> 00:39:28.090
That is not so!

00:39:29.180 --> 00:39:29.920
Nay...

00:39:31.740 --> 00:39:33.290
Regrettably,

00:39:34.100 --> 00:39:38.270
I sense that many have such inclinations...

00:39:38.270 --> 00:39:41.600
But nonetheless Sir Ieyasu would not––

00:39:41.600 --> 00:39:46.200
This letter... The brushstrokes look just like his, but...

00:39:46.200 --> 00:39:48.350
Something smells fishy...

00:39:48.800 --> 00:39:51.370
It certainly is suspicious, and that is why––

00:39:51.930 --> 00:39:55.330
No, I mean it kinda smells delicious...

00:39:55.650 --> 00:39:58.160
Kinda like, hot pot.

00:40:00.030 --> 00:40:01.420
H-Hot pot?

00:40:04.570 --> 00:40:12.400
What I’m worried about is how the surprise attacks keep happening even though none of the ninja squads I sent out catch wind of them.

00:40:13.550 --> 00:40:16.100
Even though no one’s seen forces that could be them moving about,

00:40:16.710 --> 00:40:21.150
almost every night some place gets attacked and falls.

00:40:22.570 --> 00:40:24.770
Could they be utilizing a as-of-yet unheard of weapon?

00:40:26.080 --> 00:40:29.940
In any case, that is not something Sir Ieyasu would do!

00:40:34.560 --> 00:40:35.910
Sir Masamune!

00:40:39.710 --> 00:40:41.590
LONG TIME KNOW SEE!

00:40:42.100 --> 00:40:45.420
Just where do you think you’re going with such an angry face, Sanada Yukimura?

00:40:45.420 --> 00:40:46.780
It has been ages since last we met.

00:40:46.780 --> 00:40:50.600
I am on my way to call on Sir Tokugawa Ieyasu.

00:40:50.600 --> 00:40:54.230
HM, that’s so you to be driven by righteous indignation.

00:40:54.230 --> 00:40:56.600
Word on the street is that he’s pretty tough.

00:40:56.600 --> 00:40:58.260
Be careful, bro.

00:40:58.880 --> 00:41:00.350
Nay, that is not––

00:41:00.350 --> 00:41:03.950
I’m gonna go kick around Ishida Mitsunari.

00:41:03.950 --> 00:41:08.990
I was gonna come back around to get Ieyasu too, but if you’re going I’ll leave him to you, bro.

00:41:08.990 --> 00:41:10.450
Sir Masamune––

00:41:10.450 --> 00:41:14.490
Yo, I heard you’ve succeeded the Old Tiger?

00:41:15.390 --> 00:41:16.840
...Indeed.

00:41:16.840 --> 00:41:17.990
Good job.

00:41:18.430 --> 00:41:23.050
When we’re done running errands, let’s have a PARTY to settle things.

00:41:23.050 --> 00:41:25.940
I do wish to settle things with thee.

00:41:25.940 --> 00:41:30.710
However, at this time, I am not on my way to destroy Sir Ieyasu.

00:41:30.710 --> 00:41:31.380
Hm？

00:41:32.740 --> 00:41:35.250
I am calling on him to confirm something:

00:41:35.250 --> 00:41:40.970
That Sir Ieyasu is not one who would trample down other lands as if imitating the Ishida army

00:41:40.970 --> 00:41:46.540
and tell all the generals to gather at the grounds of Sekigahara in a half-threat.

00:41:46.540 --> 00:41:48.400
Sekigahara, you say?

00:41:49.090 --> 00:41:51.900
I also have something I need to check with Ishida too.

00:41:53.040 --> 00:41:56.420
But that doesn’t change the fact that we’re going to go at it anyway.

00:42:09.100 --> 00:42:13.090
Catch you later, Sanada Yukimura.

00:42:26.750 --> 00:42:32.700
Oh yeah, this is where you and I first fought each other.

00:42:34.100 --> 00:42:35.710
That is correct.

00:42:35.710 --> 00:42:39.300
How about we settle things right now?

00:42:40.900 --> 00:42:42.290
What are you saying...

00:42:44.540 --> 00:42:45.950
Lord Masamune!

00:42:45.950 --> 00:42:50.240
I could have resisted if we met anywhere else but here, but...

00:42:51.750 --> 00:42:55.010
A match with that dude doesn’t make me COOL or HOT.

00:42:56.500 --> 00:42:59.160
Somebody wins and somebody dies.

00:42:59.160 --> 00:43:01.580
It’s just a DEATH MATCH slathered in hatred.

00:43:01.580 --> 00:43:03.480
HAD NO CHOICE!

00:43:03.480 --> 00:43:06.270
So I wanna go at it with you right now!

00:43:06.690 --> 00:43:08.770
Sanada Yukimura!

00:43:11.080 --> 00:43:12.260
Sir Masamune!?

00:43:16.590 --> 00:43:17.180
General!

00:43:17.180 --> 00:43:20.560
To not accept would be the greatest regret of my life!

00:43:20.560 --> 00:43:22.370
I feel as such!

00:44:18.120 --> 00:44:19.470
DEATH BITE!

00:44:19.470 --> 00:44:20.700
Ring of Fire!

00:44:24.560 --> 00:44:25.800
Who goes there?

00:44:25.800 --> 00:44:28.330
What are you doing, Vagabond?

00:44:28.330 --> 00:44:32.850
Just what are you guys doing when the land’s in trouble?!

00:44:34.020 --> 00:44:36.270
Sorry dude, but it’s got nothin’ to do with you.

00:44:36.270 --> 00:44:37.020
Outta my way!

00:44:37.020 --> 00:44:40.470
I get it, you’re rude. But I won’t back down!

00:44:44.440 --> 00:44:46.830
Do not interfere!

00:44:50.220 --> 00:44:50.750
Oops!

00:44:55.940 --> 00:44:56.690
SHIT!

00:44:56.690 --> 00:44:58.170
That’s it!

00:45:07.060 --> 00:45:11.220
I know how you feel, but let’s stop here, you two.

00:45:14.900 --> 00:45:16.020
You, Sir, are...

00:45:17.210 --> 00:45:18.990
I’m Maeda Keiji.

00:45:19.800 --> 00:45:21.480
This is Yumekichi.

00:45:21.480 --> 00:45:27.120
You’re Sanada Yukimura of Kai, the guy who always makes the One Eyed Dragon happy, right?

00:45:27.120 --> 00:45:28.000
Huh?

00:45:28.900 --> 00:45:29.580
How about it?

00:45:30.110 --> 00:45:37.080
Until this haze hanging over the land is neatly cleared away, why don’t you let me hold on to this match for you?

00:45:40.980 --> 00:45:44.970
Yeah. As far as I’m concerned, you’re always my GOAL.

00:45:45.810 --> 00:45:48.430
Almost forgot about that other dude.

00:45:49.270 --> 00:45:51.200
Thanks, girly-boy.

00:45:52.370 --> 00:45:55.140
What a clear spoken, cheerful personage...

00:45:55.690 --> 00:45:58.150
I shall leave it in your custody, Sir Maeda!

00:45:58.700 --> 00:45:59.830
Lord Masamune.

00:46:06.940 --> 00:46:09.530
That letter you were talking about, huh?

00:46:09.530 --> 00:46:11.330
No need to read it.

00:46:11.330 --> 00:46:19.410
I’ll find out what the hell’s going on and who’s up to what, once I get to Sekigahara.

00:46:19.410 --> 00:46:21.260
Yeah, probably.

00:46:21.260 --> 00:46:26.720
Both Ieyasu and Chosokabe Motochika, who’s running around western Japan now, should be rushing there themselves.

00:46:29.010 --> 00:46:31.950
It’s gonna be a crazy-ass PARTY.

00:46:31.950 --> 00:46:37.200
If that douche Ishida is hostin’ it, then Imma settle it with him right in the middle of it!

00:46:37.200 --> 00:46:40.950
For you, Boss...

00:46:43.560 --> 00:46:44.820
What’s this?

00:46:45.310 --> 00:46:49.110
Everyone in the Date gang talked it over and said they want you to use it, Boss.

00:46:52.020 --> 00:46:54.620
We knew you might get mad, Boss, but

00:46:54.620 --> 00:46:58.620
we got permission from Lord Katakura and we rushed to make it.

00:46:59.780 --> 00:47:05.150
It wasn’t easy to get the old smithy to sign off on it so it’s a bit late but...

00:47:05.150 --> 00:47:07.750
Use this for your fight with Ishida––

00:47:11.340 --> 00:47:16.440
The King of Misfortune, Ishida Mitsuri... is he that strong?

00:47:16.440 --> 00:47:18.720
Please accept it, Boss!

00:47:18.720 --> 00:47:18.740
Boss!
Please accept it, Boss!

00:47:18.740 --> 00:47:19.910
Boss!

00:47:21.760 --> 00:47:23.440
Lord Masamune.

00:47:23.850 --> 00:47:28.820
Lord Masamune’s life, is the life of everyone in Oshu.

00:47:49.090 --> 00:47:51.440
HM, not bad.

00:47:53.180 --> 00:47:55.340
COOL ACCESSORY, bros.

00:47:55.340 --> 00:47:57.110
I’ll use it.

00:48:01.610 --> 00:48:06.270
Her fear in hand, her fear in heart...

00:48:06.270 --> 00:48:10.690
The roots did tear her soul apart...

00:48:10.690 --> 00:48:14.410
They ate him inside out, his roots that did sprout––

00:48:15.150 --> 00:48:16.920
Um...Ms. Oichi...?

00:48:16.920 --> 00:48:20.580
Petals fall and flowers wither...

00:48:20.580 --> 00:48:23.050
D-do you want some hot pot?

00:48:23.050 --> 00:48:27.060
The voices call, "Come now! Come hither!"

00:48:28.590 --> 00:48:29.340
Legatus.

00:48:32.140 --> 00:48:35.240
I have bad news.

00:48:35.650 --> 00:48:37.900
Huh? What? What is it?

00:48:37.900 --> 00:48:44.690
Everyone has found out that you used Tokugawa Ieyasu’s name to write a fraudulent letter.

00:48:44.690 --> 00:48:45.910
Whaaaa-?

00:48:46.270 --> 00:48:54.840
It seems like the generals are quite angry and once they arrive at Sekigahara they will first destroy Kobayakawa Hideaki.

00:48:54.840 --> 00:48:57.950
Really?! Is that true?!

00:48:57.950 --> 00:49:02.550
I thought it would let everyone be friends like you said, Father Tenkai!

00:49:02.550 --> 00:49:07.900
I, more than anyone, understand how much you wish for peace, Legatus.

00:49:07.900 --> 00:49:13.150
But a mere monk cannot deal with the warriors driven by anger

00:49:13.150 --> 00:49:15.970
Deal with theeem!

00:49:15.970 --> 00:49:21.980
It is unfortunate that they will gang up and torture you to death, but you can’t avoid it.

00:49:21.980 --> 00:49:23.890
N-no waaay!

00:49:26.600 --> 00:49:28.700
Yesss.

00:49:29.850 --> 00:49:32.710
Why don’t you treat them to some hot pot?

00:49:40.900 --> 00:49:43.460
This inexhaustible darkness.

00:49:44.020 --> 00:49:48.460
Even if I were to carve death into that knave, I would not be able to annihilate it.

00:49:49.760 --> 00:49:54.420
All that awaits me is inescapable nothingness.

00:49:54.420 --> 00:49:57.730
My second death.

00:50:01.790 --> 00:50:03.020
Mitsunari.

00:50:05.930 --> 00:50:08.990
Flourish that might to your heart’s content!

00:50:11.300 --> 00:50:14.350
Let us wrench open the world together!

00:50:30.020 --> 00:50:31.580
ARE YOU READY GUYS!?

00:50:31.580 --> 00:50:33.110
YEAH!

00:50:33.110 --> 00:50:34.840
DON’T SLACK OFF!

00:50:34.860 --> 00:50:36.500
STEP ON IT!

00:50:36.500 --> 00:50:38.010
YEAH!

00:50:38.010 --> 00:50:39.400
ALL RIGHT!

00:50:39.400 --> 00:50:40.760
LET’S RIDE ON!

00:50:40.760 --> 00:50:43.290
YEAH!

00:50:44.010 --> 00:50:45.850
Ishida Mitsunari...

00:50:45.850 --> 00:50:50.020
If you’re really the one that’s gonna be waiting for me right smack dab in the middle...

00:50:50.020 --> 00:50:53.530
This time <i>I’m</i> gonna be the one who can’t forgive <i>you</i>!

00:51:19.550 --> 00:51:24.000
Um...uh...

00:51:31.070 --> 00:51:34.370
E-Everybody’s maaad!

00:51:35.820 --> 00:51:38.640
Oh no! I’m scared!

00:51:38.640 --> 00:51:40.990
What do I do, Father Tenkai!?

00:51:51.070 --> 00:51:52.510
Mr. Ieyasu!

00:51:52.510 --> 00:51:54.860
It was you, Legatus?

00:51:56.250 --> 00:51:58.590
I’m sorry, Mr. Ieyasu! I––

00:52:01.060 --> 00:52:03.660
...I see. It’s okay, Legatus.

00:52:03.660 --> 00:52:06.180
I know you didn’t mean any harm.

00:52:06.750 --> 00:52:08.180
So don’t be scared.

00:52:09.290 --> 00:52:11.890
Watch over the hot pot and serve it to everyone.

00:52:11.890 --> 00:52:13.550
O-Okay!

00:52:24.240 --> 00:52:26.430
I am Tokugawa Ieyasu.

00:52:26.430 --> 00:52:30.830
I am grateful that you responded to my appeal and gathered here today.

00:52:31.270 --> 00:52:32.290
Thank you!

00:52:34.160 --> 00:52:42.720
Everyone gathered here witnessed the dreadfulness of the two great powers, the Oda and the Toyotomi, with their own eyes.

00:52:42.720 --> 00:52:49.540
And it should have been carved deeply into your flesh and bones that military might severs the bonds between people.

00:52:49.540 --> 00:52:51.690
Ieyasu... I see...

00:52:52.950 --> 00:52:56.450
Only those that show their might rise in the world and survive.

00:52:56.450 --> 00:52:57.770
That is the nature of the Warring States.

00:52:58.250 --> 00:53:01.620
But, with that attitude, conflict will never end!

00:53:03.340 --> 00:53:07.530
We have twice seen the fall of those that rely on might alone.

00:53:08.370 --> 00:53:13.000
I don’t believe there are any here who brandish might, wishing for ruin!

00:53:14.680 --> 00:53:16.950
I am Maeda Keiji of Kaga!

00:53:16.950 --> 00:53:20.760
Do you know why you are so physically strong, my brothers?

00:53:21.120 --> 00:53:22.970
It’s so you can protect those you love.

00:53:22.970 --> 00:53:27.410
The constant threat that your hometowns, where you were born and raised, and dear things that money can’t buy, will be snatched away...

00:53:27.410 --> 00:53:30.230
Why don’t we put an end to that?

00:53:31.750 --> 00:53:35.390
I am Sanada Genjiro Yukimura of the Takeda from Kai.

00:53:35.950 --> 00:53:42.780
Heretofore at numerous battlegrounds, I have fervently crossed blades with many a warrior.

00:53:42.780 --> 00:53:47.650
The rival warlords exercised military valor to the utmost; and their aims after seizing the land...

00:53:48.410 --> 00:53:50.660
are the same: peace!

00:53:50.660 --> 00:53:57.170
Let us talk together of tomorrow along with Sirs Ieyasu and Maeda, who both, rejecting avarice and ambition,

00:53:57.170 --> 00:54:00.170
carry the true heart of a warrior!

00:54:01.290 --> 00:54:02.290
Sanada––

00:54:06.040 --> 00:54:08.150
Let us protect the bonds we have now

00:54:08.150 --> 00:54:14.140
and form new bonds with those unknown to us and those who were our enemies in the past!

00:54:14.140 --> 00:54:18.500
Come! Let us talk of a peaceful world while sipping Legatus’ hotpot!

00:54:20.470 --> 00:54:22.210
Sanada Yukimura!

00:54:22.210 --> 00:54:23.710
The Tiger of Kai...

00:54:51.880 --> 00:54:53.240
WAIT!

00:54:53.240 --> 00:54:54.810
Wait a sec.

00:54:54.810 --> 00:55:01.520
First, let’s make it clear who’s been attacking people all over the damn place.

00:55:19.270 --> 00:55:20.330
Ishida Mitsunari!

00:55:20.330 --> 00:55:21.840
It’s the King of Misfortune!

00:55:21.840 --> 00:55:23.810
The Minister of Misfortune!

00:55:25.340 --> 00:55:27.500
We’ve been waiting for you, Mitsunari.

00:55:27.500 --> 00:55:30.110
Come over here and you can talk with everyone too!

00:55:30.800 --> 00:55:32.250
Do as you please.

00:55:32.250 --> 00:55:33.600
Do not involve me.

00:55:34.140 --> 00:55:36.040
True bonds are a miracle.

00:55:36.790 --> 00:55:43.540
And the hollow words you spew forth shall never erase the resentment and hatred that stole away their joy from me!

00:56:03.480 --> 00:56:04.900
Mitsunari!

00:56:04.900 --> 00:56:06.790
They were in collusion after all!

00:56:07.830 --> 00:56:09.890
We’ve been had by Tokugawa and Ishida!

00:56:09.890 --> 00:56:10.650
Wha––

00:56:10.650 --> 00:56:13.640
Why you...! I was almost fooled!

00:56:13.640 --> 00:56:16.650
Wait! You’ve got it all wrong––

00:56:37.200 --> 00:56:42.380
Fools... Bonds are nothing more than invisible threads.

00:56:43.180 --> 00:56:45.440
Man is a creature that must quarrel.

00:56:46.020 --> 00:56:49.230
To deny this truth is the act of fools.

00:56:50.010 --> 00:56:53.290
All you pawns that have gathered at Sekigahara!

00:56:53.290 --> 00:56:56.930
Cut down all those you know not by sight!

00:56:57.470 --> 00:56:59.770
Those under a different flag are your enemies!

00:57:00.310 --> 00:57:03.180
He who wins shall be the Conqueror of the Land!

00:57:03.180 --> 00:57:06.740
This is the decisive battle!

00:57:08.490 --> 00:57:10.210
That is... Mori Motonari!

00:57:11.390 --> 00:57:14.710
A mere expendable pawn cannot defeat the likes of me.

00:57:14.710 --> 00:57:17.410
I see, as long as I win...

00:57:17.410 --> 00:57:19.160
I’ll be the Conqueror of the Land!

00:57:19.160 --> 00:57:20.660
I’ll be––

00:57:43.900 --> 00:57:47.260
That Mori... He’s much more boisterous than I expected.

00:57:47.260 --> 00:57:50.390
Thanks to him, the battlefield’s aswirl.

00:57:50.390 --> 00:57:55.000
The stage is set, so kill him as you please.

00:57:56.400 --> 00:57:57.530
You have my gratitude.

00:58:06.370 --> 00:58:09.150
Kill... Advance...

00:58:10.550 --> 00:58:12.380
General! Our defenses are at their limit!

00:58:12.380 --> 00:58:13.590
Sanada Yukimura!

00:58:14.860 --> 00:58:17.360
It seems like you’re facing a crucial decision, but

00:58:17.360 --> 00:58:19.120
it’s time for you to prepare for the worst.

00:58:19.480 --> 00:58:22.350
What are you gonna do as the commander of an army?

00:58:36.400 --> 00:58:40.950
To suppress all the roots of evil here and now at Sekigahara!

00:58:41.350 --> 00:58:43.200
The entire strength of the Takeda army shall achieve it!

00:58:43.740 --> 00:58:45.960
Counterattack!

00:58:50.800 --> 00:58:51.500
Understood!

00:58:52.800 --> 00:58:53.840
GOOD!

00:58:54.380 --> 00:58:56.640
That dude hasn’t given up.

00:58:57.110 --> 00:59:00.510
As long as he’s in it to win it, even if you cut him up once or twice,

00:59:02.140 --> 00:59:04.410
he’ll survive and claw his way back up.

00:59:04.790 --> 00:59:06.950
That is correct, One Eyed Dragon.

00:59:06.950 --> 00:59:09.230
And at that time together...

00:59:10.240 --> 00:59:12.690
Sorry bro, but I don’t like pretending to be friends.

00:59:13.290 --> 00:59:16.140
I’ll probably go at it with you someday.

00:59:16.140 --> 00:59:19.460
And I will face you with this fist when that day comes.

00:59:22.220 --> 00:59:23.530
Tokugawa Ieyasu...!

00:59:23.530 --> 00:59:26.900
I won’t let the Land of the Rising Sun become a peopleless land!

00:59:28.710 --> 00:59:31.390
I will protect bonds and friendship!

00:59:32.930 --> 00:59:37.590
Let’s treat ourselves to a contest of strength!

00:59:38.070 --> 00:59:38.970
...Kojuro.

00:59:38.970 --> 00:59:39.570
Yessir.

00:59:40.050 --> 00:59:40.850
You lot!

00:59:48.610 --> 00:59:50.490
Date Masamune...

00:59:50.490 --> 00:59:54.440
What foolish means did you use to willfully murder Lord Hideyoshi?

00:59:54.440 --> 00:59:56.690
Ishida Mitsunari.

00:59:56.690 --> 01:00:01.460
What about you? How many innocent dudes have you dragged into this mess with your grudge against me?

01:00:01.460 --> 01:00:04.760
What are you trying to do with this CRAZY uproar?

01:00:04.760 --> 01:00:06.850
That is inconsequential!

01:00:06.850 --> 01:00:10.250
I shall not forgive those who forget the power of the Toyotomi

01:00:10.250 --> 01:00:12.050
Still less those who defile them!

01:00:13.180 --> 01:00:16.640
To have only such an uptight d-bag as the head of the clan,

01:00:16.640 --> 01:00:19.050
the boss monkey must be turning in his grave!

01:00:19.050 --> 01:00:22.840
Recant all profanities you have poured on Lord Hideyoshi!

01:00:22.840 --> 01:00:25.010
I shall not accept any other words!

01:00:31.190 --> 01:00:33.350
Repent and die!

01:00:34.440 --> 01:00:36.020
HELL OR HEAVEN!

01:00:38.030 --> 01:00:39.570
X-BOLT!

01:00:42.800 --> 01:00:44.780
Be cutttttt!

01:00:48.320 --> 01:00:51.250
With this, everyone is gathered together.

01:00:51.560 --> 01:00:55.010
Mori’s participation is a godsend.

01:00:55.010 --> 01:01:01.670
It seems like even the matchlessly resourceful general has not noticed that his surprise attack actually lent us a hand.

01:01:03.180 --> 01:01:07.510
The King of Misfortune’s feelings of resentment towards those that have forgotten the Toyotomi

01:01:08.600 --> 01:01:14.370
and the pure and unselfish will of Tokugawa Ieyasu, who wishes for peace though all of the Land of the Rising Sun...

01:01:15.000 --> 01:01:20.110
It seems we can make a delicious hotpot with the finest, unadulterated ingredients.

01:01:20.480 --> 01:01:24.500
And the one to stir it up is my puppet––

01:01:24.500 --> 01:01:27.910
The Devil’s sister, Lady Oichi.

01:01:30.490 --> 01:01:32.700
What’s up with this woman?!

01:01:44.040 --> 01:01:45.590
Mitsunari,

01:01:45.590 --> 01:01:47.460
You must be overjoyed.

01:01:47.750 --> 01:01:54.720
Indeed, this must be the greatest sight for those eyes that are unforgiving of this world.

01:01:55.730 --> 01:01:59.400
W-will this really bring about peace?!

01:02:00.620 --> 01:02:02.230
Moriiiiiiii!

01:02:04.110 --> 01:02:07.700
You scallywag! Long time no see!

01:02:07.700 --> 01:02:11.560
Causin’ a ruckus and trying to profit while others fight.

01:02:11.560 --> 01:02:14.340
Up to your same old scurvy tricks, eh?

01:02:14.340 --> 01:02:16.540
Mori!

01:02:17.890 --> 01:02:22.630
Gleefully disparaging your opponent?

01:02:22.630 --> 01:02:24.000
Chosokabe,

01:02:24.000 --> 01:02:26.990
although it has not been so long, you have changed.

01:02:27.360 --> 01:02:29.970
I’m gonna return the Land of Aki to you for a bit!

01:02:30.310 --> 01:02:35.470
Just so I can beat you up right here and take it once again!

01:02:36.510 --> 01:02:39.500
Relinquish it if you please.

01:02:39.500 --> 01:02:43.730
After you are gone, Shikoku shall become an independent islet of Aki!

01:02:43.830 --> 01:02:45.480
Watch your tongue, scallywag!

01:02:59.240 --> 01:03:02.780
You have defiled Lord Hideyoshi’s land!

01:03:02.780 --> 01:03:06.670
You stole my only light!

01:03:07.810 --> 01:03:10.430
Lower your head to Lord Hideyoshi!

01:03:10.670 --> 01:03:12.920
Seek, nay! Yearn for absolution!

01:03:12.920 --> 01:03:17.930
And then give me your head!

01:03:21.190 --> 01:03:26.190
Hey, what are you gonna cry about once you get your REVENGE?

01:03:27.890 --> 01:03:29.200
Come at me, bro!

01:03:29.960 --> 01:03:33.030
This is your CLIMAX!

01:04:00.530 --> 01:04:01.100
What?!

01:04:23.210 --> 01:04:25.650
What is the matter, Magistrate?

01:04:25.650 --> 01:04:26.920
Pay it no mind.

01:04:27.520 --> 01:04:34.400
For one who has died once to know death once again and to be impressed at its impermanence...

01:04:34.400 --> 01:04:39.500
Y-Y-YOUUUU!!

01:04:48.450 --> 01:04:51.000
Especially ‘cause you’ve already died once,

01:04:51.000 --> 01:04:53.820
how dare you brandish power to survive!

01:04:53.820 --> 01:04:56.500
I’m gonna rid you of that grim reaper!

01:04:59.820 --> 01:05:02.610
JUMPING JACK BREAKER!

01:05:33.620 --> 01:05:36.700
What are you playing at, Ieyasu?!

01:05:37.750 --> 01:05:38.880
Hatred...

01:05:38.880 --> 01:05:40.100
and resentment...

01:05:40.100 --> 01:05:43.060
can all be healed with bonds, Mitsunari.

01:05:44.960 --> 01:05:46.850
I wanted to tell tha––

01:05:46.850 --> 01:05:50.120
I told you to know your place!

01:05:50.120 --> 01:05:52.400
I never asked you to save me!

01:05:52.910 --> 01:05:55.920
Go and die... like a... dog...

01:05:58.090 --> 01:06:04.000
Don’t say such a thing, Mitsu...nari...

01:06:12.090 --> 01:06:14.130
Behold, Magistrate.

01:06:14.130 --> 01:06:18.400
At last the King of Misfortune has been dragged into Ieyasu’s farce.

01:06:23.350 --> 01:06:27.980
Absolutely perfect as an hors d’oeuvres for the banquet!

01:06:59.060 --> 01:07:01.490
Let’s all make them bloom...

01:07:02.450 --> 01:07:05.220
Look, it’s almost time...

01:07:20.060 --> 01:07:21.060
Hey everybody!

01:07:21.060 --> 01:07:23.100
Watch out for those black hands!

01:07:23.100 --> 01:07:25.540
Don’t touch them!

01:07:30.520 --> 01:07:33.600
Damn that Legatus, saying unnecessary things...

01:07:33.960 --> 01:07:38.050
Father Tenkai said this was to make everyone’s hearts as one.

01:07:38.050 --> 01:07:40.800
He said this was a sacrifice for that.

01:07:40.800 --> 01:07:45.580
I thought it was right because a priest said it, but...

01:07:46.560 --> 01:07:49.290
I think it’s wrong after all!

01:07:59.690 --> 01:08:02.530
You’re too late, Legatus.

01:08:03.500 --> 01:08:06.980
I have a recollection of those black hands...

01:08:09.950 --> 01:08:11.700
Lady Oichi...

01:08:55.440 --> 01:08:57.090
What’s that...

01:09:00.560 --> 01:09:03.250
Petals fall

01:09:03.590 --> 01:09:05.360
and flowers wither,

01:09:05.360 --> 01:09:08.110
The voices call,

01:09:08.110 --> 01:09:10.080
"Come now! Come hither!"

01:09:54.200 --> 01:09:58.350
We have awakened and revivedddd!

01:09:59.000 --> 01:10:04.300
All bow down and submit to Us!

01:10:04.970 --> 01:10:07.340
Rejoiiiiiice!

01:10:09.220 --> 01:10:11.430
You foolish, greeeedy

01:10:13.500 --> 01:10:16.310
dependeeeents!

01:10:39.100 --> 01:10:41.200
The Devil King... of the Sixth Heaven!

01:10:41.200 --> 01:10:43.990
Is that... Oda... Nobunaga?!

01:10:43.990 --> 01:10:47.050
Been a while since he’s popped up...

01:10:47.050 --> 01:10:49.210
I dunno who plotted this,

01:10:49.590 --> 01:10:54.160
but you’ve been used as a setup for this SURPRISE PARTY.

01:10:54.160 --> 01:10:57.600
It was all for this, huh...

01:10:58.880 --> 01:11:01.190
Men!

01:11:01.190 --> 01:11:05.400
Spread the banquet the world over!

01:11:20.330 --> 01:11:23.090
What... astonishing power.

01:11:23.090 --> 01:11:25.510
Incomparable to his former incarnation.

01:11:31.350 --> 01:11:39.220
The sediment absorbed by the Devil Queen’s black hands has become the Devil King’s new flesh and blood.

01:11:39.220 --> 01:11:42.330
This world shall be shrouded in ruin...

01:11:43.600 --> 01:11:47.100
With this a thousand men are equally

01:11:47.100 --> 01:11:50.080
maggots squirming in an abyss of darkness!

01:11:58.200 --> 01:11:59.710
De... sist.

01:12:00.750 --> 01:12:03.700
I absolutely do not approve of your barbarity!

01:12:04.520 --> 01:12:09.550
With this, you’ll destroy the world Lord Hideyoshi ruled!

01:12:12.930 --> 01:12:15.100
Lord Hideyoshi’s dreams...

01:12:15.100 --> 01:12:17.570
Lord Hanbei’s hopes...

01:12:17.570 --> 01:12:21.100
I shall not let the likes of you efface them!

01:12:25.110 --> 01:12:28.660
Lowly monkey and his useless tail...

01:12:28.660 --> 01:12:31.070
Becoming such a fragile, sentimental soul

01:12:31.070 --> 01:12:34.360
and gazing upon the land for all eternity is worthless!

01:12:38.700 --> 01:12:44.290
To worship a feral monkey drunk with power is the pinnacle of folly!

01:13:00.270 --> 01:13:03.060
Worthless fooools!

01:13:25.180 --> 01:13:26.790
Absolutely...

01:13:26.790 --> 01:13:28.500
...unforgivable!

01:13:31.850 --> 01:13:33.920
Contemptuous Devil King...!

01:13:34.720 --> 01:13:36.500
...the likes of you...

01:13:37.080 --> 01:13:39.500
should return to Lord Hideyoshi’s...

01:13:39.820 --> 01:13:43.770
Ashes!

01:13:59.390 --> 01:14:01.390
How perspicacious!

01:14:08.090 --> 01:14:09.020
Magistrate?!

01:14:09.020 --> 01:14:10.000
What are you doing!?

01:14:11.060 --> 01:14:12.990
Why are you here!?

01:14:12.990 --> 01:14:14.720
Fall back!

01:14:14.720 --> 01:14:16.590
Fall back, Magistrate!

01:14:16.590 --> 01:14:18.720
Do not endure any more!

01:14:27.150 --> 01:14:29.020
Know the futility of your actions!

01:14:35.950 --> 01:14:37.660
Magistrate!

01:14:41.300 --> 01:14:44.420
Until now... I had not noticed...

01:14:45.260 --> 01:14:47.470
...when you thought of me...

01:14:47.470 --> 01:14:51.690
...and when I thought of you...

01:14:52.000 --> 01:14:54.090
...we felt the same way...

01:14:57.100 --> 01:15:01.460
There is no greater sorrow in the world...

01:15:04.700 --> 01:15:07.780
‘Tis laughable...

01:15:10.150 --> 01:15:11.980
Magistrate!

01:15:12.970 --> 01:15:14.200
Magistrate!

01:15:14.200 --> 01:15:16.500
I will not permit you to die!

01:15:17.410 --> 01:15:22.080
Magistrate!

01:15:23.910 --> 01:15:27.060
What a stale expiation.

01:15:27.060 --> 01:15:30.820
Magistrate, you were a mere mortal after all...

01:15:35.250 --> 01:15:36.370
Mitsunari!

01:15:36.370 --> 01:15:38.010
Take a good look at Nobunaga!

01:15:38.010 --> 01:15:42.010
Behold how Sir Hideyoshi...

01:15:42.010 --> 01:15:44.590
How we were reflected in the eyes of the people in the age of the Toyotomi!

01:15:53.390 --> 01:15:55.700
There is... no way...!

01:16:17.270 --> 01:16:20.890
Are those Mr. Devil King’s roots?!

01:16:20.890 --> 01:16:25.210
You say those countless black hands are the Devil King’s roots?

01:16:25.580 --> 01:16:28.350
The Devil King has not yet fully resurrected.

01:16:28.350 --> 01:16:30.400
If we cut them now...

01:16:30.860 --> 01:16:32.240
Kojuro!

01:16:32.240 --> 01:16:33.400
Understood.

01:16:34.400 --> 01:16:35.410
May victory smile upon us.

01:16:37.030 --> 01:16:38.590
Sasuke!

01:16:38.590 --> 01:16:41.030
I entrust the Takeda Army to you!

01:16:41.030 --> 01:16:42.410
Roger that but...

01:16:42.410 --> 01:16:45.270
Does second in command get a salary?

01:16:59.980 --> 01:17:01.750
It’s now or never!

01:17:01.750 --> 01:17:03.890
I leave the rest to you, Kojuro!

01:17:03.890 --> 01:17:06.730
Milord! I beg your forgiveness!

01:17:06.730 --> 01:17:10.470
I, Yukimura, shall become a sacrificial pawn for the land!

01:17:10.470 --> 01:17:14.950
Toshi, Matsu, be happy...!

01:17:14.950 --> 01:17:20.120
I trust that everyone will be united with bonds after I’m gone...

01:17:33.800 --> 01:17:37.460
Wind, Forest, Fire, Shadow; Mountain, Lightning, Water!

01:17:37.530 --> 01:17:40.790
Smile lightly, light of the east!

01:17:40.790 --> 01:17:44.960
All I do, I do in the name of love!

01:17:54.660 --> 01:17:57.490
IT’S ONE-EYES DRAGON!!

01:18:29.030 --> 01:18:32.570
Ah... Finally we can kill each other...

01:18:32.570 --> 01:18:34.150
Lord Nobunaga...

01:18:44.800 --> 01:18:48.410
We... cannot perish...

01:18:49.160 --> 01:18:53.620
For We have already periiiiished once before!

01:19:00.280 --> 01:19:01.630
Ichi.

01:19:01.630 --> 01:19:04.460
Don’t run away, Ichi!

01:19:04.460 --> 01:19:06.960
Now is the time to pay close attention.

01:19:09.640 --> 01:19:12.580
Lord... Nagamasa?

01:19:12.580 --> 01:19:17.270
I say, it is Lady Oichi. You were still here?

01:19:17.270 --> 01:19:20.250
Thank you very much for fulfilling your role.

01:19:21.060 --> 01:19:25.240
I, Tenkai, shall see you off to the abyss!

01:19:30.710 --> 01:19:31.620
What?

01:19:37.920 --> 01:19:38.750
Oh my...

01:19:40.130 --> 01:19:43.680
Um, am I out of alignment?

01:19:44.500 --> 01:19:45.300
Yes.

01:19:45.300 --> 01:19:47.750
W-wait a minute, please!

01:19:54.730 --> 01:19:56.950
Don’t–– Don’t eat me!

01:19:56.950 --> 01:19:58.900
I don’t taste good!

01:19:59.560 --> 01:20:00.100
But!

01:20:00.100 --> 01:20:01.190
Leave that...

01:20:02.190 --> 01:20:04.510
...for last!

01:20:09.700 --> 01:20:11.270
Demonnn...

01:20:11.270 --> 01:20:13.800
of 50 years!

01:20:20.320 --> 01:20:22.700
Lord...Hideyoshi...

01:20:22.700 --> 01:20:26.050
For me to fall to ruin here uncouthly,

01:20:27.200 --> 01:20:30.790
I beg your permission!

01:20:36.120 --> 01:20:37.650
On my blade: censure!

01:20:37.650 --> 01:20:40.390
On my scabbard: redemption!

01:20:48.500 --> 01:20:50.340
Mitsu...nari!

01:20:54.280 --> 01:20:57.420
Not even a tickle!

01:21:14.350 --> 01:21:17.700
Now is the time to atone, Ichi.

01:21:18.830 --> 01:21:22.280
Only you can do it.

01:21:28.450 --> 01:21:30.120
Lord... Nagamasa.

01:21:41.340 --> 01:21:42.350
Brother...

01:21:42.660 --> 01:21:43.450
Lady...

01:21:43.450 --> 01:21:44.330
Oichi...

01:21:48.090 --> 01:21:51.110
The Devil King’s... sister...

01:21:51.610 --> 01:21:53.740
Let’s go to sleep.

01:21:56.920 --> 01:21:59.110
The fifth heaven?!

01:21:59.110 --> 01:22:01.260
You fool!

01:22:02.410 --> 01:22:06.100
Ichi will always be with you...

01:22:24.740 --> 01:22:29.450
These arms... are... comfortable...

01:22:30.690 --> 01:22:34.640
It cannot be hel–

01:22:54.170 --> 01:22:57.490
Hey everybody!

01:22:58.410 --> 01:22:59.480
Tadakatsu!

01:23:00.170 --> 01:23:03.370
Heeey!

01:23:39.070 --> 01:23:43.140
Do not forget your crime of stealing away Lord Hideyoshi’s future...

01:23:43.140 --> 01:23:45.660
If you prove yourself to be a unsightly little snake,

01:23:45.660 --> 01:23:48.330
I shall execute you on the spot.

01:23:48.330 --> 01:23:50.070
Refusal is not an option.

01:23:50.070 --> 01:23:51.970
Bring it.

01:23:51.970 --> 01:23:54.440
You’d be doubling my fun.

01:23:55.670 --> 01:23:57.970
You are Maeda Keiji?

01:23:58.500 --> 01:23:59.600
Yeah.

01:24:00.530 --> 01:24:01.650
I have a favor to ask...

01:24:02.500 --> 01:24:06.480
What is it? I’ll do what I can to help.

01:24:07.870 --> 01:24:14.000
Someday, I would like you to tell me stories about the Lord Hideyoshi I did not know.

01:24:20.960 --> 01:24:24.120
Sure. Anytime, no problem.

01:24:25.910 --> 01:24:27.540
Sir Ieyasu.

01:24:28.210 --> 01:24:30.070
What is it, Sanada?

01:24:30.070 --> 01:24:36.800
I thought I relinquished the name of the Tiger when my determination on this occasion proved insufficient.

01:24:37.490 --> 01:24:43.940
Mayhaps the one truly worthy of succeeding the spirit of the Tiger in posterity, is you, Sire.

01:24:43.940 --> 01:24:48.490
I have always revered Sir Shingen as my mentor in spirit.

01:24:48.490 --> 01:24:49.690
And I revere him as such still.

01:24:50.460 --> 01:24:52.290
But you are different.

01:24:52.290 --> 01:24:57.190
Your bonds with Sir Shingen are surely thicker and hotter than blood.

01:24:57.730 --> 01:25:02.530
Complete and honest devotion, convey that to the next Tiger.

01:25:03.350 --> 01:25:05.950
Understood!

01:25:08.590 --> 01:25:09.390
Mitsunari.

01:25:10.530 --> 01:25:16.700
I hope to someday rule over the country with you with the power of bonds.

01:25:17.870 --> 01:25:23.640
To succeed the wishes of someone you love dearly... is also and important bond.

01:25:24.960 --> 01:25:26.760
I shan’t collude with you.

01:25:28.110 --> 01:25:29.500
That’s what I thought you’d say.

01:25:32.000 --> 01:25:33.360
So how about this:

01:25:34.250 --> 01:25:36.860
Why don’t we settle this with force?

01:25:39.270 --> 01:25:40.300
Fine.

01:25:41.460 --> 01:25:46.560
Let’s treat ourselves to our long-awaited PARTY, Sanada Yukimura.

01:25:48.930 --> 01:25:51.200
I shall take that challenge!

01:25:56.510 --> 01:25:58.090
GOOD LUCK.

01:26:01.670 --> 01:26:02.570
Farewell.

01:26:05.400 --> 01:26:06.900
Come on, everybody!

01:26:06.900 --> 01:26:10.430
Let’s have one last genuinely big fight!

01:26:10.430 --> 01:26:14.690
Let’s decide the winners and losers with no hard feelings!

01:26:19.530 --> 01:26:22.040
You’re pretty sullen, Mori!

01:26:22.600 --> 01:26:29.170
Fool... My ingenuity and military prowess are not inferior to yours in the slightest.

01:26:29.170 --> 01:26:30.840
Don’t hold it in!

01:26:30.840 --> 01:26:33.860
It’s written all over your face you want to have a load taken off,

01:26:33.860 --> 01:26:36.370
so I’ll settle things with you!

01:26:36.370 --> 01:26:39.820
It should be the fond ambition of a pirate to become one with the ocean.

01:26:39.820 --> 01:26:43.080
I shall make that anchor of yours your gravestone at the bottom of the sea!

01:26:53.770 --> 01:26:58.060
The battles of the rival warlords continued on without end.

01:27:06.570 --> 01:27:09.230
Lord Hideyoshi, Lord Hanbei,

01:27:10.700 --> 01:27:14.640
I beg your permission to commit this act of insolence here and now!

01:27:15.950 --> 01:27:20.000
Your teachings shall be in this heart of mine for the rest of my life!

01:27:22.840 --> 01:27:27.630
Will those in control of the battlefield become the supreme rulers of the Warring States,

01:27:28.200 --> 01:27:33.160
or will they be unable to end the turbulent times even with the passing of the Battle of Sekigahara?

01:27:33.160 --> 01:27:34.910
Let’s form a bond, Mitsunari!

01:27:35.390 --> 01:27:38.230
I feel I can build a stronger bond with you than anyone else!

01:27:38.640 --> 01:27:44.280
With you, you who risks your life in pure devotion to someone, I know I definitely can!

01:27:44.730 --> 01:27:51.070
Only the bonds and the burning spirits of these warriors know the answer.

01:27:53.550 --> 01:27:56.250
One Eyed Dragon: Date Masamune!

01:27:56.250 --> 01:27:59.370
Let us fulfill our ultimate oath here and now!

01:27:59.370 --> 01:28:01.370
BE SATISFIED.

01:28:01.370 --> 01:28:05.620
Don’t let me get a GOAL IN so easily, Sanada Yukimura!

01:28:47.140 --> 01:28:49.260
The Supreme Spears of Heaven!

01:28:49.260 --> 01:28:51.590
Sanada Yukimura, has arrived!

01:28:53.850 --> 01:28:58.270
The Head of the Oshu Gang, Date Masamune, I guess I’m here.

01:29:29.620 --> 01:29:35.010
The cool and the wild befit
this bewitching moonlit night

01:29:35.010 --> 01:29:39.430
Though drinking in refinement
is not a bad match either

01:29:40.270 --> 01:29:45.590
With a snap of the fingers,
light the signal fire or nothing will begin

01:29:45.590 --> 01:29:49.950
Driven into a corner,
cut to pieces, has it already come to this?

01:29:51.000 --> 01:30:00.960
Living the life of the naked sword means even in the darkness shadows fall behind my back

01:30:01.600 --> 01:30:06.560
Falling forward as I am tempted to fall back

01:30:06.560 --> 01:30:11.450
”Don’t be stingy, show me tomorrow!”

01:30:12.700 --> 01:30:17.880
Party on! Burning soul! Priceless!

01:30:17.880 --> 01:30:23.250
The party’s fire will never burn out

01:30:23.250 --> 01:30:25.990
Let's dance! Warriors!

01:30:25.990 --> 01:30:28.610
Let’s be honest, it’s the end of times

01:30:28.610 --> 01:30:33.940
Isn’t being super flashy in good taste now? Pile it on!

01:30:33.940 --> 01:30:38.890
The only way out of this decisive battle is victory

01:30:39.290 --> 01:30:43.030
So keep on partying!

01:30:52.200 --> 01:30:57.620
I am resolved, but every last one of them is too desperate

01:30:57.620 --> 01:31:02.030
Gotta save room for desert so that even fate is moved

01:31:02.920 --> 01:31:13.700
The brevity and the deep color of the fading, red twilight layers onto my body

01:31:13.700 --> 01:31:23.400
Looking from the back of a runaway horse, if its tail is facing east, which way is tomorrow?

01:31:24.600 --> 01:31:29.950
Party on! Burning blood! Deep in a dream!

01:31:29.950 --> 01:31:34.990
Drunk on waking up, I can't stop now!

01:31:34.990 --> 01:31:40.600
Let's dance! Warriors! Go and do it right now!

01:31:40.600 --> 01:31:45.920
Watching from on high would be a mistake!

01:31:45.920 --> 01:31:55.620
Seize the searing, shooting star of this decisive moment

01:32:14.970 --> 01:32:24.790
Living the life of the naked sword, show me the age beyond!

01:32:25.880 --> 01:32:31.320
Party on! Burning soul! Priceless!

01:32:31.320 --> 01:32:36.540
The party’s fire will never burn out

01:32:36.540 --> 01:32:39.300
Let's dance! Warriors!

01:32:39.300 --> 01:32:41.850
Let’s be honest, it’s the end of times

01:32:41.850 --> 01:32:47.310
Isn’t being super flashy in good taste now? Pile it on!

01:32:47.310 --> 01:32:52.560
Party on! Burning blood! Deep in a dream!

01:32:52.560 --> 01:32:57.470
Drunk on waking up, I can't stop now!

01:32:57.780 --> 01:33:03.220
One last round! Don't be stingy now!

01:33:03.220 --> 01:33:08.640
Embrace the age with elegance because

01:33:08.640 --> 01:33:13.950
The only way out of this decisive battle is victory

01:33:13.950 --> 01:33:20.570
So keep on partying!
